1
00:00:01,500 --> 00:00:04,169
What does Dulux Accredited actually check?

2
00:00:05,556 --> 00:00:06,879
To stay in the programme

3
00:00:06,949 --> 00:00:09,839
a painter has to hold current company registration

4
00:00:09,910 --> 00:00:14,112
and carry at least two million dollars of public liability insurance.

5
00:00:14,356 --> 00:00:17,572
Those are monitored by an independent compliance service

6
00:00:17,677 --> 00:00:19,348
not by Dulux itself.

7
00:00:20,793 --> 00:00:21,918
What it doesn't do:

8
00:00:21,989 --> 00:00:25,099
Dulux isn't responsible for the painter's workmanship.

9
00:00:25,205 --> 00:00:26,527
The painter is.

10
00:00:26,633 --> 00:00:28,896
So the badge means the basics are checked.

11
00:00:29,036 --> 00:00:31,996
It doesn't replace asking what prep is in your quote.

12
00:00:33,382 --> 00:00:36,365
There's no public list of accredited painters to browse.

13
00:00:36,552 --> 00:00:39,175
Dulux takes your details and matches you.

14
00:00:39,489 --> 00:00:41,764
Or, if you're in North Auckland

15
00:00:41,834 --> 00:00:43,598
you can come straight to us.

16
00:00:45,043 --> 00:00:46,586
We're mh painting.

17
00:00:46,657 --> 00:00:49,291
Dulux Accredited, across North Auckland.

18
00:00:49,536 --> 00:00:53,076
The full breakdown is at mhpainting.co.

